---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Navbar activePage="journey" />

  <main>
    <section class="journey-header">
      <p class="section-label">MY JOURNEY</p>
      <h1>From curiosity to cybersecurity.</h1>
    </section>

    <div class="timeline">
      <!-- 1. THE BEGINNING -->
      <section class="journey-card">
        <p class="card-label">THE BEGINNING</p>
        <h2>It started with curiosity.</h2>
        <p>
          My fascination with technology began not just with using digital systems, but with asking the deeper question: <em>how do they actually break?</em> That persistent drive to understand system internals, security flaws, and attack logic pushed me to pursue a dedicated career in offensive security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 2. THE FOUNDATION -->
      <section class="milestone">
        <div class="milestone-content">
          <p class="card-label">THE FOUNDATION</p>

          <h2>B.Sc. Cyber Security</h2>

          <p>
            My academic journey gave me the foundation I needed to turn
            my curiosity into something more structured.
          </p>

          <p>
            I graduated with a B.Sc. in Cyber Security from REVA University,
            finishing with a CGPA of 9.08 and graduating as a Gold Medalist.
          </p>

          <p>
            For me, the gold medal wasn't just an achievement. It was
            confirmation that the effort I was putting into understanding
            cybersecurity was taking me in the right direction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="milestone-image">
          <img
            src="/images/graduation-gold-medal.jpg"
            alt="Pawan R at graduation"
            width="2048"
            height="1365"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 3. GETTING HANDS-ON -->
      <section class="hands-on">
        <div class="hands-on-content">
          <p class="card-label">GETTING HANDS-ON</p>

          <h2>Learning by doing.</h2>

          <p>
            Alongside my degree, I started exploring cybersecurity through
            hands-on platforms like TryHackMe.
          </p>

          <p>
            What started as a way to practice what I was learning quickly
            became one of the most important parts of my learning journey.
            I worked through rooms and challenges covering areas such as
            web security, networking, Linux, privilege escalation, and
            other security fundamentals.
          </p>

          <p>
            TryHackMe taught me something that theory alone couldn't:
            understanding a security concept is one thing, but actually
            applying it against a target is where the learning becomes real.
          </p>

          <div class="thm-highlight">
            <strong>Top 2% globally</strong>
            <span>TryHackMe ranking</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 4. BUILDING PRACTICAL SKILLS -->
      <section class="certifications">
        <div class="certifications-header">
          <p class="card-label">BUILDING PRACTICAL SKILLS</p>

          <h2>Turning curiosity into practical skills.</h2>

          <p>
            Alongside my academic foundation, I started focusing more
            on hands-on security training and practical offensive security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="certification-grid">
          <div class="certification-card">
            <img src="/images/ejpt.png" alt="eJPT certification" width="1276" height="981" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <h3>eJPT</h3>
            <p>
              My first major step into structured penetration testing, helping me strengthen the fundamentals of network and web security through practical assessment scenarios.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="certification-card">
            <img src="/images/ewpt.png" alt="eWPT certification" width="1270" height="982" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <h3>eWPT</h3>
            <p>
              Deepening my focus on web application security and learning to approach applications from an attacker's perspective.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="certification-card">
            <img src="/images/icca.png" alt="ICCA certification" width="1266" height="980" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <h3>ICCA</h3>
            <p>
              Expanding my security knowledge into cloud environments and understanding the fundamentals of securing cloud infrastructure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 5. BEYOND THE CLASSROOM -->
      <section class="conference">
        <div class="conference-header">
          <p class="card-label">BEYOND THE CLASSROOM</p>

          <h2>BSides Bangalore 2026</h2>

          <p>
            Cybersecurity is more than learning from courses and labs.
            Being part of the security community gives me an opportunity
            to learn from practitioners, researchers, and other security
            enthusiasts.
          </p>

          <p>
            In July 2026, I attended the Security BSides Bangalore Annual
            Cybersecurity Conference, where I got to experience technical
            talks, research presentations, workshops, hacking villages,
            panel discussions, and other activities from the cybersecurity
            community.
          </p>

          <div class="conference-details">
            <span>📍 Bengaluru</span>
            <span>📅 July 9, 2026</span>
            <span>🎓 8 CPE Credits</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="conference-images">
          <div class="conference-photo">
            <img
              src="/images/bsides-bangalore-2026.jpg"
              alt="Pawan R at BSides Bangalore 2026"
              width="3024"
              height="4032"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="conference-certificate">
            <img
              src="/images/bsides-bangalore-2026-certificate.png"
              alt="BSides Bangalore 2026 certificate of participation"
              width="2000"
              height="1414"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 6. FIRST PROFESSIONAL OPPORTUNITY -->
      <section class="professional-journey">
        <div class="professional-content">
          <p class="card-label">FIRST PROFESSIONAL OPPORTUNITY</p>

          <h2>From learning to doing it professionally.</h2>

          <p>
            My first professional opportunity in cybersecurity came through an internship at <strong>SecIQ Technologies LLP</strong>, where I got the opportunity to receive hands-on training and develop my understanding of web security.
          </p>

          <p>
            What started as an internship became an important turning point in my journey. I was able to learn in a professional environment, work with real-world security concepts, and understand how penetration testing is approached beyond labs and learning platforms.
          </p>

          <p>
            After my internship, I was fortunate to receive a full-time opportunity at SecIQ Technologies LLP. I joined on <strong>3 July 2025</strong>, and the experience since then has given me valuable exposure to cybersecurity, penetration testing, and continuous learning.
          </p>

          <p>
            Since joining, I've had the opportunity to grow from someone learning the fundamentals into a security professional who is continuously exploring, testing, and understanding how real-world systems can be secured.
          </p>

          <p>
            One of the highlights of this journey was receiving the <strong>Best Newbie Award</strong> at SecIQ Technologies LLP — a recognition that made my early professional journey especially meaningful.
          </p>

          <div class="role-highlights">
            <div class="role-badge">
              <span class="role-date">3 July 2025 → Present</span>
              <strong class="role-company">SecIQ Technologies LLP</strong>
              <span class="role-title">Internship → Full-time Security Professional</span>
            </div>

            <div class="award-badge">
              🏆 <strong>Best Newbie Award</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="timeline-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

      <!-- 7. WHERE I'M GOING -->
      <section class="future-section">
        <div class="future-content">
          <p class="card-label">WHERE I'M GOING</p>

          <h2>The journey doesn't have a final destination.</h2>

          <p>
            Cybersecurity is constantly changing, and so is my understanding of it. There is always another system to understand, another vulnerability to investigate, and another concept to learn.
          </p>

          <p>
            I'm continuing to build my skills through hands-on work, research, labs, and real-world security assessments.
          </p>

          <p>
            I don't have everything figured out — and I'm okay with that.
          </p>

          <div class="mindset-block">
            <p class="mindset-lead">For me, the goal is simple:</p>

            <ul class="mindset-list">
              <li>Keep learning.</li>
              <li>Keep questioning.</li>
              <li>Keep breaking things.</li>
              <li>Keep building.</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="mindset-closing">
              And wherever this journey takes me, I want to remain curious enough to keep asking:
              <br />
              <em>“How does this actually work?”</em>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    padding-top: 128px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .journey-header {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px 40px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .section-label,
  .card-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-label);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-display);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .journey-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px;
  }

  .journey-card h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .journey-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: var(--measure-narrow);
  }

  .timeline-connector {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 22px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .timeline-connector::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -24px;
    bottom: -24px;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent,
      var(--line-strong) 18%,
      var(--line-strong) 82%,
      transparent
    );
    z-index: -1;
  }

  /* Milestone */
  .milestone {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .milestone-content {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px;
  }

  .milestone-content h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .milestone-content p:not(.card-label) {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    max-width: var(--measure-narrow);
  }

  .milestone-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .milestone-image {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .milestone-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 380px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .hands-on,
  .professional-journey,
  .future-section {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .certifications,
  .conference {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .hands-on-content,
  .professional-content,
  .future-content {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px;
  }

  .hands-on-content h2,
  .certifications-header h2,
  .conference-header h2,
  .professional-content h2,
  .future-content h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .hands-on-content p:not(.card-label),
  .certifications-header p:not(.card-label),
  .conference-header p:not(.card-label),
  .professional-content p:not(.card-label),
  .future-content p:not(.card-label) {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    max-width: var(--measure-narrow);
  }

  .hands-on-content p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .thm-highlight {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 8px 0 8px 18px;
  }

  .thm-highlight strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .thm-highlight span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* Certifications */
  .certifications-header,
  .conference-header {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .certification-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .certification-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .certification-card img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--bg);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    padding: 10px;
  }

  .certification-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .certification-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Conference */
  .conference-header {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .conference-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .conference-details span {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-chip);
    color: var(--text-on-card);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 15px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .conference-images {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .conference-photo,
  .conference-certificate {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .conference-images img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: 280px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* Professional journey */
  .role-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .role-badge {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .role-date {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .role-company {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .role-title {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .award-badge {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-chip);
    color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  /* Future */
  .mindset-block {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .future-content p.mindset-lead {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .mindset-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 14px 0 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .mindset-list li {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .mindset-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .future-content p.mindset-closing {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .mindset-closing em {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 359px) {
    main {
      padding-top: 128px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    main {
      padding-top: 112px;
      padding-bottom: 72px;
    }

    .journey-header,
    .timeline {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .journey-card,
    .milestone-content,
    .hands-on-content,
    .professional-content,
    .future-content {
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }

    .milestone {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .certification-grid,
    .conference-images {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .conference-images img {
      height: 220px;
    }

    .conference-details {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .role-highlights {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .award-badge {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>